      "message": "Fix NameError in doc_link.rb: use nested module form\n\nIn the released udb gem, calling the CLI causes a `NameError`.\n\nAccording to Copilot, this is because:\n\nWhen bin/udb loads udb/cli, the require chain (cli -> resolver ->\ncfg_arch -> non_isa_specification -> database_obj -> doc_link) reaches\ndoc_link.rb before lib/udb.rb is loaded. doc_link.rb uses the compact\nclass notation `class Udb::DocLink` which requires the Udb constant to\nalready exist, causing:\n\n```\n  uninitialized constant Udb (NameError)\n  class Udb::DocLink\n```\n\nFix by replacing the compact notation with the nested module form\n(`module Udb; class DocLink`), which is self-contained and defines the\nmodule if it doesn't already exist.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "8228f308f035110a259820ce806addf147da2f25",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/riscv/riscv-unified-db/git/trees/8228f308f035110a259820ce806addf147da2f25"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/riscv/riscv-unified-db/git/commits/d5978b85c0847d18cb1e5d1d0b1101d166182011",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgR89gEhu5K19kaQl8YAyJZi8NiX\n/CZxACi9WAVW6RM5oAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDZI3gnObGlgDoUvQT+n8Hd0ME2qBcoXi21XU64tdPM0PuhH2K4MRFpmGZByfst0GF\nyLEV9T5sj1vh8DKgH+iwo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----",
        "payload": "tree 8228f308f035110a259820ce806addf147da2f25\nparent 10a153700c3544884a2267b1b4f5cd18eb429848\nauthor Jordan Carlin <jordanmcarlin@gmail.com> 1774051666 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Carlin <jordanmcarlin@gmail.com> 1774051666 -0700\n\nFix NameError in doc_link.rb: use nested module form\n\nIn the released udb gem, calling the CLI causes a `NameError`.\n\nAccording to Copilot, this is because:\n\nWhen bin/udb loads udb/cli, the require chain (cli -> resolver ->\ncfg_arch -> non_isa_specification -> database_obj -> doc_link) reaches\ndoc_link.rb before lib/udb.rb is loaded. doc_link.rb uses the compact\nclass notation `class Udb::DocLink` which requires the Udb constant to\nalready exist, causing:\n\n```\n  uninitialized constant Udb (NameError)\n  class Udb::DocLink\n```\n\nFix by replacing the compact notation with the nested module form\n(`module Udb; class DocLink`), which is self-contained and defines the\nmodule if it doesn't already exist.\n",
        "verified_at": "2026-03-21T00:10:19Z"
      }
    },
